; error: 10:18: 'inc' is a '[bind @r]' lambda, which changes what it keeps, so it is never copied: call it, 'inc(…)', or give it as a place, '&inc', to a 'flex& f: [bind @r](int) -> nothing' parameter
; A '[bind @r]' lambda is never copied: a copy would share what it changes.

task main()
    region r
    flex xs = [1, ...] at r
    flex inc = [bind @r](n: int) -> nothing
        xs[0] = xs[0] + n
    fi
    flex other = inc
    other(2)
fi
